OL,3,GNEWSATony Hadley 'still at it' after 50
OL,4,Ayears in music
OL,5,
OL,6,FTony Hadley has described the success
OL,7,Fhe had as lead singer of Spandau Ballet
OL,8,Fas "phenomenal" as he prepares for his
OL,9,Flatest solo tour.
OL,11,FThe singer of Gold, True and many other
OL,12,F80s hits is setting off on his
OL,13,FChristmas Big Band Tour, including a
OL,14,FNovember date at the White Rock Theatre
OL,15,Fin Hastings.
OL,17,FHadley is celebrating 50 years in the
OL,18,Fmusic industry, having co-founded the
OL,19,Ffirst iteration of Spandau Ballet in
OL,20,F1976.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
