OL,3,GNEWSATony Hadley 'still at it' after 50
OL,4,Ayears in music
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "To sign a record deal when
OL,7,Fyou're 20 and then to have a top five
OL,8,Fsingle with To Cut a Long Story Short,
OL,9,Fthat was incredible."
